OL,3,GNEWSAFlight chaos caused by
OL,4,A'millisecond' software defect, report
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn air traffic control failure that
OL,8,Fsparked widespread travel chaos earlier
OL,9,Fthis month was caused by a "software
OL,10,Fdefect" affecting the system
OL,11,Funderpinning UK air space management,
OL,12,Fthe national air traffic service Nats
OL,13,Fhas said.
OL,15,FThe problem happened "in the space of a
OL,16,Fmillisecond", Nats said, leading to the
OL,17,Fsystem producing corrupted data.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
